WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Welcome to Ball Mastery Lab. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.560
Jr. Your goal is an adaptable technical practice

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.360
record. Choose a safe space and an activity

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.480
appropriate to your experience, with qualified guidance where

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.280
needed. Keep your work private, record what you

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.720
tried, and set a review date. Physical demonstrations

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.240
require qualified review; stop for pain or unsafe

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.400
conditions and seek appropriate support.
